</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Although a man with men become,</l><l>Yet Thou with God eternal art!</l><l>The same completeness Thou dost share,</l><l>And infinite as God Thou art!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thine origin, the same as God,</l><l>Before creation was decreed!</l><l>Before the foremost, Thou art first,</l><l>None other doth Thyself precede!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thou never changest thru all time,</l><l>Thy years are to eternity!</l><l>None is as lasting as Thyself,</l><l>Nor is there any after Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Just as the Father, diff’ring not,</l><l>The same perfection Thou too hast!</l><l>Thou art the Alpha and the First,</l><l>Thou art Omega and the Last!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>We praise Thee for Thine endless years,</l><l>Extol Thee for Thy perfectness!</l><l>Admiring all Thy fulness vast,</l><l>We marvel at Thy boundlessness!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
